ots 1
# journey-save-load: new game, buy a Multi-Cannon, save to slot 1, quit to the title, load slot 1.
# Authored against ot-ref-run (virtual clock); the title menu is ready at ~8.1 s.
# title: Start New Game
@8500 key-down RETURN
@8560 key-up RETURN
# Players: 1 Player Full Game
@10300 key-down RETURN
@10360 key-up RETURN
# Episode 1: Escape
@12100 key-down RETURN
@12160 key-up RETURN
# Difficulty: Normal
@13900 key-down RETURN
@13960 key-up RETURN
# Game Menu: Upgrade Ship, Front Gun: buy Multi-Cannon (cash 10000 -> 9750)
@15000 key-down DOWN
@15060 key-up DOWN
@15300 key-down DOWN
@15360 key-up DOWN
@15600 key-down RETURN
@15660 key-up RETURN
@16500 key-down DOWN
@16560 key-up DOWN
@16800 key-down RETURN
@16860 key-up RETURN
@17400 key-down DOWN
@17460 key-up DOWN
@17700 key-down RETURN
@17760 key-up RETURN
@18000 key-down RETURN
@18060 key-up RETURN
# Upgrade Ship: Done
@18600 key-down UP
@18660 key-up UP
@18900 key-down UP
@18960 key-up UP
@19200 key-down RETURN
@19260 key-up RETURN
# Game Menu: Options
@20100 key-down DOWN
@20160 key-up DOWN
@20400 key-down RETURN
@20460 key-up RETURN
# Options: Save Game
@21300 key-down DOWN
@21360 key-up DOWN
@21600 key-down RETURN
@21660 key-up RETURN
# Save: slot 1
@22500 key-down RETURN
@22560 key-up RETURN
# Save name: PARITY, then RETURN saves
@23400 text "PARITY"
@23800 key-down RETURN
@23860 key-up RETURN
# Save: Escape back to Options, Escape to Game Menu
@24900 key-down ESCAPE
@24960 key-up ESCAPE
@25800 key-down ESCAPE
@25860 key-up ESCAPE
# Game Menu: Quit Game, confirm
@26700 key-down DOWN
@26760 key-up DOWN
@27000 key-down DOWN
@27060 key-up DOWN
@27300 key-down RETURN
@27360 key-up RETURN
@28400 key-down RETURN
@28460 key-up RETURN
# title: Load Game
@31200 key-down DOWN
@31260 key-up DOWN
@31500 key-down RETURN
@31560 key-up RETURN
# Load: slot 1
@33300 key-down RETURN
@33360 key-up RETURN
